ing state prior to a past action."],"correctIndex":1},{"number":8,"section":"English Language","contextText":null,"imageAssetPath":null,"questionText":"Choose the improvement: They could not admire his bright performance because of they dislike him.","options":["because of their disliking of him","because of their dislike him","because they dislike him","No correction required"],"correctIndex":2},{"number":9,"section":"English Language","contextText":null,"imageAssetPath":null,"questionText":"Choose the improvement: She was uneasy because she never on a plane before.","options":["had never been","never been","is never been","No improvement"],"correctIndex":0},{"number":10,"section":"English Language","contextText":null,"imageAssetPath":null,"questionText":"Choose the improvement: They only work when they have no money.","options":["When they have no money, they only work","They only work","work only when","No improvement"],"correctIndex":2},{"number":11,"section":"English Language","contextText":null,"imageAssetPath":null,"questionText":"No sooner had the train departed ______ the signal failed.","options":["then","that","when","than"],"correctIndex":3},{"number":12,"section":"English Language","contextText":null,"imageAssetPath":null,"questionText":"Choose the meaning of “inchoate”.","options":["Excessive","Just beginning","Unchangeable","Fully developed"],"correctIndex":1},{"number":13,"section":"English Language","contextText":null,"imageAssetPath":null,"questionText":"The witness's statement was at variance ______ the evidence.","options":["with","to","for","by"],"correctIndex":0},{"number":14,"section":"English Language","contextText":null,"imageAssetPath":null,"questionText":"If she ______ the warning, the accident could have been avoided.","options":["has heeded","had heeded","heeded","would heed"],"correctIndex":1},{"number":15,"section":"English Language","contextText":null,"imageAssetPath":null,"questionText":"Choose the correctly spelled word.","options":